Revenue Model
Revenue Stream: Enterprise Data Sales / Bandwidth Monetization
Description: Menjual akses ke data web terstruktur (scraping result) dan bandwidth jaringan node ke laboratorium AI, perusahaan riset data, dan platform LLM melalui kontrak B2B / API
Status: Live (Mainnet — mulai Epoch 7 / Post-TGEkommerzialisasi aktif)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/architecture/data-sales]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]
Revenue Stream: Protocol Fees (Planned)
Description: Potensial fee pada transaksi data di Sovereign Data Rollup atau fee swap/bridging token GRASS (belum diaktifkan/dikonfirmasi resmi)
Status: Planned
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/tokenomics]
Revenue Stream: Treasury Yield
Description: Menghasilkan yield dari stablecoin/asset treasury via lending (Kamino/Solend) atau staking SOL (jika treasury diversifikasi) — belum dikonfirmasi aktif
Status: Planned / Tidak Dikonfirmasi
Sources
(LOW) [General Industry Practice for Crypto Foundations]
Revenue Stream: Grant
Description: Menerima grant dari Solana Foundation atau ekosistem lain (jika ada) — tidak diungkap jumlahnya
Status: Discontinued / Tidak Dikonfirmasi Aktif
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Solana Foundation Grants, https://solana.org/grants]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/solana-ecosystem/]

