Fundraising Mechanism
Mechanism: VC Funding (Equity + SAFT)
Details: Putaran Seed dan Strategic melalui pembelian equity di Wynd Labs dan/atau SAFT (Simple Agreement for Future Tokens) untuk alokasi token GRASS investor
Sources
(HIGH) [The Block, https://www.theblock.co/post/250000/grass-raises-seed-funding]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]
Mechanism: Public Token Sale via Launchpad
Details: Binance Launchpool (Farming BNB/FDUSD untuk GRASS) — distribusi token ke publik tanpa pembelian langsung (gratis/farming), sekaligus listing liquidity
Sources
(HIGH) [Binance Announcement, https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/grass-listing]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-token-launch/]
Mechanism: Protocol Revenue (Future)
Details: Pendapatan dari penjualan data AI dan fee rollup dijadikan sumber dana operasional Foundation jangka panjang
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Grass Docs, https://docs.grass.ai/tokenomics]

Token Sale
Sale Type: Binance Launchpool (Public Farming)
Date: 2024-10-28 s.d. 2024-11-03 (Periode Farming 7 hari)
Status: Completed
Allocation: 30,000,000 GRASS (3% Total Supply) dialokasikan untuk Launchpool rewards
Sources
(HIGH) [Binance Announcement, https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/grass-listing]; [CoinGecko, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/grass]
Sale Type: Private Token Allocation (Investor/Team/Foundation via SAFT)
Date: 2023-07 (Seed) & 2023-12 (Strategic) — Token minted at TGE 2024-10-28
Status: Completed (Token generated at TGE, subject to vesting)
Notes: Bukan public sale terpisah; alokasi investor/team/foundation termaktub di tokenomics dan divesting via smart contract vesting (Streamflow/Cliff)
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog Tokenomics, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-tokenomics/]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]; [Solscan Token Vesting Programs, https://solscan.io/token/GRASS...#vesting]

Financial Dependencies
Dependency: Venture Capital Investors (Polychain, Hack VC, Delphi, Brevan Howard, dll)
Role: Sumber dana operasional awal Wynd Labs (R&D, gaji, infrastruktur) sebelum revenue protocol berjalan
Sources
(HIGH) [The Block, https://www.theblock.co/post/250000/grass-raises-seed-funding]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]
Dependency: Token Treasury (Grass Foundation)
Role: Sumber dana jangka panjang untuk ekosistem, grant builder, insentif komunitas, dan operasional Foundation via penjualan/manajemen token GRASS
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/introducing-grass-foundation/]; [Grass Docs Tokenomics, https://docs.grass.ai/tokenomics]
Dependency: Market Makers (Wintermute, GSR Markets)
Role: Menyediakan likuiditas order book CEX/DEX agar token GRASS dapat diperdagangkan dan treasury dapat mencairkan aset jika diperlukan
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-token-launch/]; [Wintermute Twitter, https://x.com/wintermute_t]; [GSR Twitter, https://x.com/GSR_io]
Dependency: Centralized Exchanges (Binance, Bybit, Coinbase, dll)
Role: Akses pasar primer untuk likuiditas token dan onboarding pengguna baru (fiat on-ramp)
Sources
(HIGH) [Binance Announcement, https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/grass-listing]; [CoinGecko Markets Tab Grass, https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/grass#markets]
Dependency: Enterprise Data Buyers (AI Labs)
Role: Sumber revenue protocol jangka panjang (product-market fit) — belum terbukti skala signifikan secara publik
Sources
(MEDIUM) [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]; [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]

Financial Risk
Risk: Treasury Concentration Risk (Native Token)
Detail: Mayoritas aset treasury berupa token GRASS (volatile) — nilai treasury berfluktuasi drastis mengikuti harga pasar token
Sources
(HIGH) [Grass Blog Tokenomics, https://blog.grass.ai/grass-tokenomics/]; [Solscan Treasury Address, https://solscan.io/account/...]
Risk: Revenue Uncertainty / Pre-Revenue Stage
Detail: Model pendapatan (penjualan data ke AI) masih tahap awal komersialisasi; tidak ada laporan pendapatan historis yang diverifikasi; operasional bergantung pada treasury token dan dana VC tersisa
Sources
(HIGH) [Messari, https://messari.io/project/grass/profile]; [Grass Blog, https://blog.grass.ai/sovereign-data-rollup/]
Risk: Funding Runway Dependency
Detail: Wynd Labs (entity dev) bergantung pada sisa dana Seed/Strategic atau Series A baru untuk gaji tim inti hingga revenue/grant Foundation mencukupi
Sources
(MEDIUM) [The Block, https://www.theblock.co/post/250000/grass-raises-seed-funding]; [General Startup Financial Model]
Risk: Regulatory Financial Risk (Token Classification)
Detail: Risiko token GRASS diklasifikasikan sebagai security oleh regulator (SEC dll) berdampak pada likuiditas, listing CEX, dan kemampuan Foundation mencairkan treasury
Sources
(MEDIUM) [SEC Crypto Enforcement Actions, https://www.sec.gov/spotlight/cybersecurity-enforcement-actions]; [Grass Blog Legal Disclaimer, https://grass.ai/terms]
Risk: Data Scraping Legal Liability
Detail: Potensial gugatan hukum (GDPR, CFAA, Copyright) atas praktik scraping bandwidth pengguna yang dapat menciptakan biaya hukum/kompensasi finansial besar
Sources
(MEDIUM) [TechCrunch AI Scraping Lawsuits, https://techcrunch.com/tag/ai-scraping-lawsuits/]; [Grass Blog Legal/Privacy, https://grass.ai/privacy]

